# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your key, then never commit `.env`.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# The MBTA V3 API key is FREE and can be obtained at https://api-v3.mbta.com/portal
#
# You do NOT need a key to run the default pipeline. The bulk historical data
# lives on performancedata.mbta.com and is fully public, and the V3 API allows
# 20 anonymous requests/minute, which is far more than the live collector in
# this repo uses (~3 requests/minute). A key raises the limit to 1000 req/min
# and is required only for the V3 streaming (SSE) endpoint.
MBTA_API_KEY=
